<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GOLD COAST, Australia 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Gold</p>
<p>Coast Classic women's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second Round</p>
<p>Maria Luisa Serna (Spain) beat Annabel Ellwood (Australia) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) beat Jana Kandarr (Germany) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>4-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Nathalie Dechy (France) 5-7</p>
<p>7-5 6-4</p>
</text>
